          instr: "Questions 14–17<br>Look at the following ideas (Questions 14–17) and the list of researchers below.<br>Match each idea with the correct researcher, <b>A</b>, <b>B</b> or <b>C</b>.<br><b>NB</b> You may use any letter more than once.",
